        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sandakwajeanda Neajeeda geang'aamwa Giriyat-yearimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu goobalool Dawdi shirikareeda hees ambal sagalamnyoojiga ea gea ambal bughalajeega ea giliwas siida haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Dawdi fuga sean bwat geat bea Israeli, “Iyoadaayi gideaba aamiy aba heedeang'wa, ak ea gidagassiida NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, anung' eecheaksiina buweadeagaasa ghayi sinung'wi jeeda ng'eanyiisean bea Israeli, ak geabwada ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi mida mujiinajeega mideawa heeda mida nyeega, ak ghapka gabassa geat heedeanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geebiikti eeteelna sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETEANYA gabiigu heedeanya; ghayi sifool aba damanda Sawli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwas buuneeda sean bwat geat gideaba gaygwasin ng'asheanji, aba gideaba ng'asheanji aamiy aba madeeda gheanyanga buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwada geat Dawdi buuneesean bea Israeli ghang'eada Shihoreeda Misri ea ghwahita ghuuta seawadeeda Hamati, gweadu sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA aba Giriat-yeariimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwascheang'da Dawdi sea buuneesean bea Israeli ea ghwahita Baala, nea Giriat-yeariimu gil mida ng'eanyiida Yuda, gweana hoowa sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA, siguuriisa aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA abiita iheenga geeruubajeanda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Geeruubajeanda: Gheawunga diyeanga mideawa meang'eega bea humng'eeda, gadiyeeda nyaawa gafur heeda ghaydit bea ASEETA (Ging 3:24)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geayaada sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA badayda mutukoodeesh, ghang'eada gheeh Abinadabu, nea Usa ea Ahiyo ghamwanmwan mutuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gahoosan Dawdi sea Israeleesean aba madeeda ASEETA aba uurjeenga nyaawa sean, nea gwasarman nea gaba gureayeeka ea gidoondoorajeega ea bundajeega ea igeambooniga ea durumbeatajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu bugharjeanda Gidoni, ghoahaakta geadi Usa ghoang'waay sandakwajeanda neajeeda, aba gideaba gwateemban heewga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayeat nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Usa; ak ghwalas aba gideaba ghoang'waay sandakwajeanda neajeeda; ak gameewsa geeshangiga aba madeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyareas Dawdi aba gideaba nilas NG'UTAMIIDA Usa; ak geeguura gheawungeaba ng'eanyiita Beres-usa ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghoawal Dawdi ASEETA eaweedida; ak gwayi, “Gaydaataaydaan gheenyu sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mwaada Dawdi sandakwajeanda neajeeda gheanyi aba jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi, hean ghwasach ak ghwaat gheeh Obed-edomu bea eemeeda Giti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goobiida sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA gheeh Obed-edomu sheeh samwagu; ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA ghawooda gheeh Obed-edomu ea haleanjeeda sean mideawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
